<!-- The release placeholder below is substituted at build time from the
     top-level panda-server-release.txt, so this points at the documentation
     for the server release the image was built against. -->
<h2>PandABlocks-server</h2>

<p>
  The TCP server is meant for integration into Control systems like EPICS and
  Tango. It exposes an ASCII Control interface on port 8888 and a binary Data
  interface on port 8889.
</p>

<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
   href="https://pandablocks.github.io/PandABlocks-server/@RELEASE@/">
  TCP Server Documentation
</a>
